 ε σ α → (Unit → EStateM.{u} ε σ β) → EStateM.{u} ε σ β","unsafe":false,"value":61,"source":{"code":"/--\nSequences two `EStateM ε σ` actions, running `x` before `y`. The first action's return value is\nignored.\n-/\n@[always_inline, inline]\nprotected def seqRight (x : EStateM ε σ α) (y : Unit → EStateM ε σ β) : EStateM ε σ β := fun s =>\n  match x s with\n  | Result.ok _ s    => y () s\n  | Result.error e s => Result.error e s","start":4475,"end":4483},"axioms":[]}